  "releaseNotes": "10.0.0: first release. CensusTests and CensusRuleAttribute (a census reports its flagged subjects per rule id and the base applies the project's dated solhigson-exceptions.txt), CensusOfCensusesTests (every abstract census of this package inherited exactly once, every exceptions line's rule id declared), AsyncLifetimeTestBase (set-up and a once-only tear-down over xunit v2's IAsyncLifetime), CSharpSource (the consumer repository's .cs files parsed once each through Roslyn, with their invocations and declarations), MarkupScan (a tag's closing '>', a view's inline script body and a form's posted names, over Razor and HTML).",
